      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在同步进行电疗和热疗的同时\n也要在可行范围内适当运动，防止运动机能下降……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd87accac1c7f01e715969cc0ec82a04322a9c9a1263b4ff3f747b12e62737a",
