    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e03c192cab15844d3333343",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥的努力取得了成效，\n得以比原先预计更早地\n恢复正常训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92dc9206ccb8b2bb5d08c9070b4d7b0031126e933a5eab8666b699d97fdabfbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
